# Numerical analysis of the 4D point-mass model: one simulation (transient ->
# pumping limit cycle), a reproduction of the ECC2026 equilibria figure
# (test/publications/ECC2026/figs/equilibria_phase_space.pdf, generated by 3_equilibria.jl
# with Makie) using Plots.jl only, and heatmaps of the basins of attraction of
# the two limit cycles (N_ε over two 2D slices of initial conditions, three
# visualizations each).
using Pkg
Pkg.activate(@__DIR__)

